@Inventory_Item_Management_Microservice_HostAddress = http://localhost:5031

### Create Item
POST {{Inventory_Item_Management_Microservice_HostAddress}}/api/inventory-items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "itemName": "Wireless Mouse",
  "category": "Electronics",
  "quantity": 50,
  "isActive": true
}

### Get Item by ID
GET {{Inventory_Item_Management_Microservice_HostAddress}}/api/inventory-items/{{itemId}}

### List Items (paginated)
GET {{Inventory_Item_Management_Microservice_HostAddress}}/api/inventory-items?page=1&pageSize=10&includeInactive=false

### Update Item
PUT {{Inventory_Item_Management_Microservice_HostAddress}}/api/inventory-items/{{itemId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "itemName": "Wireless Mouse Pro",
  "category": "Electronics",
  "quantity": 45,
  "isActive": true
}

### Soft Delete Item
DELETE {{Inventory_Item_Management_Microservice_HostAddress}}/api/inventory-items/{{itemId}}
